"The same, one second before the kill: how far the crosshair had to travel" = "То же за секунду до фрага: сколько прицелу пришлось пройти"
"The scoreboard and every kill are the same as logs.tf's. It lacks who assisted each kill and when each point was capped after the first, so ratings may move a little when a later sync swaps in the real log." = "Таблица и каждое убийство такие же, как на logs.tf. Не хватает того, кто ассистировал каждому убийству, и времени каждого захвата после первого, поэтому рейтинги могут немного сдвинуться, когда следующая синхронизация подтянет настоящий лог."
"The season is pulled towards 1.00 by three officials' worth of average games, so a short season cannot run away with it: one official's rating varies by about 0.19 around a player's level, players' levels by about 0.11, which is what three measures." = ""
"The season rating" = ""
"The season rating adds 0.075 for every 0.10 above 1.00, and takes it off below." = ""
"The season tables rank by this number. An award needs enough of the season: 60% of the most officials anyone in the division played that season, and never fewer than four, so a Premiership season of seven games asks for fewer than a Low season of ten." = ""
